  "sourceText": "Spicy Meatloaf\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:22am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 lbs. hamburger\n1 sm. onion, chopped\n4 (8 oz.) cans taco sauce\n1 teaspoon each garlic powder\nonion powder (not salt)\n6 hard taco shells, finely crushed\n2 teaspoons beef bouillon crystals or 2 cubes crushed\n2 eggs\n2 teaspoons Worcestershire sauce\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients thoroughly. Shape and put in pan. Bake at 350 degrees about 1 hour.",
